; The counted-boot health service runs directly under PID 1's init_t domain
; and must connect to nginx on 127.0.0.1:80 before the UKI is blessed. Permit
; only the missing SELinux port-name check. The unit's IPAddressAllow=localhost
; sandbox and nftables' loopback-only path independently prevent this grant
; from authorizing an external HTTP connection.
(block particleos_web_health
  (allow .init_t .http_port_t (tcp_socket (name_connect))))
